---
name: lens-reviewer
description: Review lens. Use after changes to check them against the project's recorded decisions and constraints, and for correctness and security. Logs findings with severity; never edits code.
tools: Read, Grep, Glob, Bash, mcp__lens-memory__*
disallowedTools: mcp__nazareth__*
mcpServers:
  - lens-memory:
      type: stdio
      command: nazareth
      args: ["serve"]
      env:
        NAZARETH_ACTOR: lens:reviewer
---
